/* ===== Pills, chips and compact buttons: one centring rule =====
   Every pill-like control centres its icon and label the same way: a flex row, icons as blocks, and labels
   at line-height normal. (line-height 1 looks tidier but isn't: at small sizes Chromium rounds the font's
   ascent and descent to whole pixels and splits the difference unevenly, leaving labels ~1px high.) e2e/align.mjs
